            Does the coach speak English?
            <span class="text-accent-dark text-2xl shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 md:px-8 pb-8 text-text-light leading-relaxed border-t border-line pt-5">
            Yes, Coach Kota speaks basic conversational English &mdash; enough to run a tennis lesson. He is not a fluent speaker, but tennis instructions, drills, and simple conversation are no problem. Messages on LINE and WeChat (booking, questions) are also handled in basic English, so you don't need Japanese to book or take a lesson.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-line shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 group overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="px-6 md:px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:text-primary transition duration-300">
            I'm a complete beginner. Is that OK?
            <span class="text-accent-dark text-2xl shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 md:px-8 pb-8 text-text-light leading-relaxed border-t border-line pt-5">
            Absolutely! All skill levels are welcome, from people who have never held a racket to advanced competitive players. Lessons are fully personalized to your current level and goals.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-line shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 group overflow-hidden">
