            No. Rackets, balls and indoor court shoes are all free to rent, so you can turn up empty-handed — just bring sportswear. You are of course welcome to bring your own racket and shoes if you prefer.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-line shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 group overflow-hidden">
