            Yes &mdash; WeChat works exactly the same as LINE for us. Scan the QR code in the &ldquo;How to Book&rdquo; section, or search the WeChat ID <span class="font-bold text-text">Oshinobi_Tennis</span> under &ldquo;Add Contacts&rdquo;.<br /><br />
