        </details>

        <details class="bg-white rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-line shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 group overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="px-6 md:px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:text-primary transition duration-300">
            How do I get to the venue from central Sapporo?
            <span class="text-accent-dark text-2xl shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
